prometheus-node-exporter-ucode

A rewrite of OpenWrt's prometheus-node-exporter-ucode and
prometheus-node-exporter-lua packages (https://github.com/openwrt/packages,
utils/), both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The collectors
keep those packages' metric names and follow their logic.

